Create a 2x2 sheet of four separate visual effects with wide empty space between them, on a pure black #000000 background with nothing else in it:
1. top left: a ring of crimson-and-orange corona flame tendrils around an empty black centre;
2. top right: a radial burst of ember-orange sparks and small flame flecks;
3. bottom left: a single silver-white falling star with a long tapering tail, diagonal from upper right to lower left;
4. bottom right: a soft crimson glow puff with a few silver star specks.
Semi-realistic painterly effects, glowing, palette limited to blood crimson #C8102E, ember orange #FF7A1A and polished silver #C9CED6. No text, no borders. 1:1.
